  "reviewed_contract": {
    "app_update_reconciliation": "Accepted ORB-101 / ADR 0016: PATCH one existing numeric App identity. Reconcile inherited source defaults, generated Routes and runtime projections through the Gateway. Omitted fields stay unchanged; updates never deploy. Preserve AppResponse JSON including nulls and request ID. Do not invent remote progress phases or claim rollback without verified outcome.",
    "app_update_explicit_fields": "Explicit positive numeric app argument; --slug, --repository, --default-branch and --root are optional values with null defaults, but at least one nonempty update is required. Empty update fails app.update_required before Gateway IO. No prompts, consent or override flags exist; do not infer a generic destructive-consent gap or add flags for this ordinary update. Preserve app.id_invalid, app.slug_invalid and app.repository_invalid. Never reintroduce --main-branch.",
    "app_update_repository_safety": "Preserve repository input checks and generic error messages: reject embedded credentials, query/fragment, unsafe/control/whitespace values, oversized input and invalid URI parsing. Do not echo rejected secrets. Gateway owns repository identity/preflight/source-switch failures and incomplete-operation retry contracts."
